"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr ""
"Étape 2 : Optimiser le problème pour l'exécution sur du matériel quantique "
"{#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "ISA circuit {#isa-circuit}"
msgstr "Circuit ISA {#isa-circuit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before running the circuit on hardware, optimize it for hardware execution. "
"This process involves a few steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Avant d'exécuter le circuit sur le matériel, optimise-le pour l'exécution "
"matérielle. Ce processus comprend plusieurs étapes :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Pick a qubit layout that maps the virtual qubits of your circuit to physical"
" qubits on the hardware.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Insert swap gates as needed to route interactions between qubits that are "
"not connected.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Translate the gates in our circuit to [Instruction Set Architecture "
"(ISA)](/guides/transpile#instruction-set-architecture) instructions that can"
" directly be executed on the hardware.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Perform circuit optimizations to minimize the circuit depth and gate "
"count.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Although the transpiler built into Qiskit can perform all of these steps, "
"this tutorial demonstrates building the utility-scale Trotter circuit in a "
"ground-up fashion. Select the good physical qubits and define entangling "
"layers on connected qubit pairs from those selected qubits. Nonetheless, you"
" still need to translate non-ISA gates in the circuit and avail any circuit "
"optimization offered by the transpiler.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bien que le transpiler intégré à Qiskit puisse effectuer toutes ces étapes, "
"ce tutoriel montre comment construire le circuit de Trotter à l'échelle "
"utilitaire de manière ascendante. Sélectionne les bons qubits physiques et "
"définis les couches d'intrication sur les paires de qubits connectés parmi "
"les qubits sélectionnés. Néanmoins, tu dois toujours traduire les portes "
"non-ISA dans le circuit et exploiter toute optimisation de circuit offerte "
"par le transpiler.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Transpile your circuit for the chosen backend by creating a pass manager and"
" then running the pass manager on the circuit. Also, fix the initial layout "
"of the circuit to the already selected `good_qubits`. An easy way to create "
"a pass manager is to use the "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)"
" function. See [Transpile with pass managers](/guides/transpile-with-pass-"
"managers) for a more detailed explanation of transpiling with pass "
"managers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Transpile ton circuit pour le backend choisi en créant un gestionnaire de "
"passes puis en exécutant le gestionnaire de passes sur le circuit. Fixe "
"également la disposition initiale du circuit aux `good_qubits` déjà "
"sélectionnés. Un moyen simple de créer un gestionnaire de passes est "
"d'utiliser la fonction "
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)."
" Consulte [Transpiler avec des gestionnaires de passes](/guides/transpile-"
"with-pass-managers) pour une explication plus détaillée de la transpilation "
"avec des gestionnaires de passes.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "ISA observables {#isa-observables}"
msgstr "Observables ISA {#isa-observables}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, create all weight-1 $\\langle Z \\rangle$ observables for each virtual"
" qubit by padding the necessary number of $\\langle I \\rangle$ terms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ensuite, crée toutes les observables $\\langle Z \\rangle$ de poids 1 pour "
"chaque qubit virtuel en complétant avec le nombre nécessaire de termes "
"$\\langle I \\rangle$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The transpilation process has mapped the virtual qubits of your circuit to "
"physical qubits on the hardware. The information about the qubit layout is "
"stored in the `layout` attribute of the transpiled circuit. Your observable "
"is also defined in terms of the virtual qubits, so you need to apply this "
"layout to the observable. This is done using the `apply_layout` method of "
"`SparsePauliOp`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Le processus de transpilation a mappé les qubits virtuels de ton circuit "
"vers les qubits physiques du matériel. L'information sur la disposition des "
"qubits est stockée dans l'attribut `layout` du circuit transpilé. Ton "
"observable est également définie en termes de qubits virtuels, tu dois donc "
"appliquer cette disposition à l'observable. Cela se fait en utilisant la "
"méthode `apply_layout` de `SparsePauliOp`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notice that each observable is wrapped in a list in the following code "
"block. It is done to *broadcast* with parameter values so that each qubit "
"observable is measured for each theta value. Find the broadcasting rules for"
" primitives in the [primitives documentation](/guides/primitives).\n"
msgstr ""
"Note que chaque observable est encapsulée dans une liste dans le bloc de "
"code suivant. Cela permet le _broadcasting_ avec les valeurs de paramètres "
"afin que chaque observable de qubit soit mesurée pour chaque valeur de "
"theta. Les règles de broadcasting pour les primitives sont disponibles "
"[ici](/guides/primitives).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-"
"primitives}"
msgstr ""
"Étape 3 : Exécuter en utilisant les primitives Qiskit {#step-3-execute-"
"using-qiskit-primitives}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
